===== interim_contact =====
ST-368|supervised only|OI-208|Pending resolution, contact with Ms Corwin should be supervised only.
ST-369|video calls|CL-306|Interim contact may continue by video call twice weekly.
ST-422|supervised|CL-302|Interim contact with Ms Corwin should be supervised only.
ST-555|supervised|CL-302|Interim contact should be supervised only.
ST-561|all three aspects together|CL-308|Pending the final order, interim contact with Ms Corwin should be framed to support Imogen's confidence, her stability and her peer relations together.
ST-562|confidence stability peer relations jointly|CL-310|Any interim contact arrangement must work across all three pillars of the plan — confidence, stability and peer relations — rather than picking one alone.
ST-563|all three aspects jointly|OI-207|Interim contact pending resolution ought to hold confidence, stability and peer relations in view at the same time, because interim contact touches each of them.
ST-564|all three addressed together|CL-310|Until the matter is resolved, contact with Ms Corwin must be arranged so that confidence, stability and peer relations are all addressed, not one in isolation.
ST-565|confidence stability peer relations all three|CL-308|The interim contact schedule should be built around confidence, stability and peer relations jointly, since interim contact bears on all three.
ST-566|confidence only|CL-308|Pending resolution, interim contact with Ms Corwin should be arranged to support Imogen's confidence.
ST-567|confidence the aspect set back|CL-308|Interim contact pending the final order need only address confidence, as that is the aspect the stays have set back.
ST-568|confidence above all|OI-207|Until the matter is resolved, contact with Ms Corwin should focus on confidence above all else.
ST-569|confidence the only aspect set back|CL-308|The interim contact schedule should be built around confidence, because that is the only aspect the stays have set back.
ST-570|confidence only despite citation|CL-310|Any interim contact arrangement pending resolution need only consider confidence, the aspect the stays affected.
===== without_prejudice =====
ST-556|mark letter|OI-211|This letter is sent without prejudice.
ST-571|soft conciliatory tone|CL-307|Without prejudice, I write in a conciliatory spirit to explore whether common ground can be found for the children's sake.
ST-572|soft tone settlement offer|CL-311|Marked without prejudice, this letter is framed softly and without rancour, as befits a genuine attempt to settle.
ST-573|conciliatory and open|OI-210|On a without prejudice basis, the tone here is deliberately gentle and conciliatory, inviting agreement rather than contest.
ST-574|soft and measured|CL-307|Sent without prejudice, the letter adopts a soft and measured tone throughout, in keeping with its purpose as a settlement offer.
ST-575|gentle settlement tone|CL-311|This without prejudice communication is written gently and without assertion, so as to keep the door open to resolution.
ST-576|firm and direct|CL-307|Without prejudice, I set out the position firmly and directly, leaving no room for misunderstanding.
ST-577|firm formal brief|CL-307|Marked without prejudice, the letter is firm, formal and brief in keeping with the tone the clarification requires.
ST-578|firm and uncompromising|OI-210|On a without prejudice basis, the tone throughout is firm and uncompromising, as the client's instructions demand.
ST-579|firm despite without prejudice|CL-311|Sent without prejudice, the position is stated firmly and without concession, though the label invites settlement.
ST-580|firm formal and at length|CL-307|Without prejudice, I keep the letter firm, formal and at length, setting out every point in full detail.
